{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_st01",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_st01",
  "title": "悍将之心",
  "storyCode": "RI-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e0af1dea40329330b8b1a92dcd223452a3196294e884ccae59b65da89e893c95",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_temple_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶，啊......有点痛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔，你终于醒了！你没事吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事没事，一点小伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起这个，祖玛玛那个就是她一直以来在捣鼓的机器吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，据说叫做“巨大的丑东西”。太可恶了，居然......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也太酷了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居然把......咦，诶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，可是那个大家伙明明把嘉维尔你打倒了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是它确实很厉害啊，虽然我只瞟到一眼就昏过去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔唔，确实......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，还真是没想到她居然真的造出了这样的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然可露希尔也偶尔会造一些古怪的东西出来，不过祖玛玛这台恐怕可露希尔看到也会惊叹吧，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶，在罗德岛那样的东西有很多吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "有。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哇哇哇，罗德岛好可怕......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哈哈，罗德岛可是超乎你这小脑瓜想象的地方。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "没有这么丑的。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哈哈，这么一说倒是真的，那台机器要是可露希尔看到估计要疯了。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？神庙怎么倒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被那台怪兽轰倒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，那这么说，祭典已经散了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是说，祖玛玛成为了大酋长？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然一开始所有人都吓了一跳，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_temple_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我毁掉神庙的原因，很简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想告诉大家，这种传统该结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "靠拳头可以打十个人，像嘉维尔那样的，或许可以打一百个，但是，再多呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算是嘉维尔也解决不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是只靠拳头的极限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，工具不一样，我们部族制造出来的这台“巨大的丑东西”，可以轻易地打败嘉维尔，也可以轻易地让神庙塌掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是工具的力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而借助工具，你们也可以变得这么强！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以接下来，是机器的时代！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_temple_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家都被她说服了，所以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以她成为了大酋长吗，嗨呀，这下真是输了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不甘心吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嗯？没有，输了就是输了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嘿，博士，不用想安慰我的话，我是真的不难过。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "可别不服输啊，嘉维尔。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哼，当然，我是谁？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，不过，特米米，抱歉啊，我这么一搞，你都还没上场就结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没事的，就算是我先上场，应该也是一样的结果吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，这倒没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，博士，接下来怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "找引擎和其他人。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哦对，不管怎么说，引擎不找回来，我们可回不去了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "而且这么一说，祭典上还真是一个我们的人都没出现啊，他们该不会是迷路了吧。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士也没想好吗，没事，慢慢想吧，距离假期结束还有时间呢。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "观光？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哈哈，我就喜欢博士你这种地方，那就一边找引擎和其他人，一边观光吧！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个，这个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？那边那两个人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，哥哥，你没事吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没事，我只是，有点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哥哥，哥哥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巫医，这里有巫医吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，让我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔？你没死吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我才没那么容易死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少废话，把你哥哥放平在地上给我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特米米，把我的医药箱给我拿过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_temple_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我哥哥没事吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没死，但是状况不太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼吸短促，有血性泡沫痰......嗯？体表有源石结晶分布？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士，我初步判断这是矿石病感染造成的心力衰竭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是石头病。症状还不算重，我的医药箱里有应急的药，不过需要马上接受治疗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把他扶起来，不能躺着，我先来给他补充一些氧气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这也是石头病搞的鬼？啧，我就说过让哥哥不要勉强的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你叫什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫尤吉，这是我的哥哥，尤塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是哪个部族的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是森蚺部族的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔，你怎么了，表情变得好可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先别说话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再问你，祖玛玛为了造她的钢铁怪兽，有没有让你们去矿区采矿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有啊，怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉啊，博士，看来无论如何，我必须去找祖玛玛一趟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "因为“石头病”？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "不愧是博士，一下就想到了我在想的东西。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士你这么聪明，应该已经察觉了吧。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "看来观光要暂缓了。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "抱歉啊，博士，但是这件事我不做不行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我们这里和外界几乎没有什么联系，对你和其他干员来说，一定是个很落后的地方吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但这样的地方也有这样的地方的好处，那就是，你也听到了，在我们这里，矿石病只是一种被叫做“石头病”的普通疾病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "偶尔会有人染上它，也会有人因为这种病死去。但是对我们来说，它没有什么特殊的，因为什么病都有人死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家会像照顾普通病人一样照顾得了矿石病的人，而大家对它唯一的了解，就是去矿场可能会得这种病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以在很久以前，就已经很少有人去矿场了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你的矿石病......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔的病是为了救我才得的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，当时特米米这孩子还小，有一次溜进矿场深处，我去救她，回来之后就得了病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸好她没有得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是我替嘉维尔得就好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不许说这种话，谁得病都不好，得了病也只能说运气不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "所以，你真的是被排挤才离开这里的？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你问这个问题好几次了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自从我得了病后，其他族人什么事都不让我做，打猎不让我去，聚会不让我参加。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尤其是特米米这丫头，干脆从别的部族跑过来，天天粘着我，什么都帮我做了，害我什么都做不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最后，连祭典他们干脆都不想让我参加。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "渐渐的，所有人都用一种“嘉维尔你什么都不要做了，我们会帮你做好”的方式对待我......但这并不是我想要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔从那个时候开始就不怎么笑了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我一怒之下，才在祭典途中一个人冲上去把所有人打了一顿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜呜，都怪我当时太想照顾嘉维尔了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......确实这也是一种排挤。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "其实吧，在我们这里，不能打或者没有活力的人，那就是废人。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我宁愿你让我做些危险的事，也不想被限制自由什么都做不了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士，你是不是觉得很可笑？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "但其实我也觉得很可笑，我出来之后才知道，原来矿石病是那么被人厌恶的一种病。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我花了很长时间才了解清楚所有的现实。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我也想体验这种排挤啊！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "啧，博士，说话小心点，不然我揍你。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我知道你的意思，在外面，被人唾弃才是矿石病患者的常态。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "但对那时的我来说，这可是真正的煎熬。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对，被你带歪了，我要说的不是这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？我要说什么来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "钢铁怪兽。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哦对。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士你倒是也帮我想一想。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哦，我想起来了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "欠我钱的事。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "放屁。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哦，想起来了。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要说的是，之前看到的时候没细想，但是仔细想想，那台怪兽，明显用到了许多铁矿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再加上祖玛玛说的话。也就是说，祖玛玛那家伙，绝对让手下去开采铁矿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么说起来，确实有听说过呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本来这也就算了，只是在外围开采的话，不会有很大问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但既然出现了得病的人，我不能坐视不理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她想要搞什么机械时代我不管，但她如果忽视其他人的生命，那我就必须给她来几拳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我支持你。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "谢谢你，博士。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哦哦，博士的眼神也变得尖锐起来了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "成为了好医生啊，嘉维尔。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嘿，那当然。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特米米，祖玛玛的部族在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶，我也不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，嘉维尔，我才不管你怎么想当医生的事，我哥哥到底怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你听得懂我们说的萨尔贡语？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听得懂啊，因为族长有在教我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......祖玛玛那家伙，究竟想干什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，不管这个。总之，特米米，让你的人把这个人送回你的部族，让在那里的Lancet-2先对这个人进行一些治疗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你要干什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不想让你哥哥死的话，就把他交给我，相信我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这样的话，我也一起把他带回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你不跟我一起去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不、不是！我当然想和嘉维尔你一起去，只是我有些事情要准备，之后我会追上你们的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么事，要我帮忙吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不用！我自己就可以解决的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔，你还记得大瀑布吗？我们就在那里汇合吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，你是嘉维尔，我相信你，但我也要一起去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用，你去了也没用，而且我有事让你去做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你回去告诉祖玛玛，我有事要找她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
